{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1833","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Musical Puzzle"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Vlad decided to compose a melody on his guitar. Let's represent the melody as a sequence of notes corresponding to the characters 'a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f', and 'g'."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"However, Vlad is not very experienced in playing the guitar and can only record "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly two"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" notes at a time. Vlad wants to obtain the melody $$$s$$$, and to do this, he can merge the recorded melodies together. In this case, the last sound of the first melody must match the first sound of the second melody."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if Vlad recorded the melodies "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ba\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", he can merge them together and obtain the melody "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"aba\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and then merge the result with "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" to get "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"abab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Help Vlad determine the "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of melodies consisting of two notes that he needs to record in order to obtain the melody $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of input contains an integer $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 10^4$$$) — the number of test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Following that are the descriptions of the test cases."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$2 \\le n \\le 50$$$) — the length of the melody $$$s$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains a string $$$s$$$ of length $$$n$$$, consisting of characters 'a', 'b', 'c', 'd', 'e', 'f', 'g'."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output $$$t$$$ integers, each representing the answer for the corresponding test case. As the answer output "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"minimum"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" number of melodies consisting of two notes that Vlad needs to record."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n4\nabab\n7\nabacaba\n6\naaaaaa\n7\nabcdefg\n5\nbabdd\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n4\n1\n6\n4\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first sample, you need to record the melodies "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ba\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", as described in the problem statement."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample, you need to record the melodies "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ab\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ba\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ac\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", and "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"ca\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third sample, the only necessary melody is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"\"aa\""}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"1833A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1833/problem/A"}